--------------
ANALYZE TABLE Course, Prereq, Antireq, `User`, Checklist
--------------

+-------------------------+---------+----------+----------+
| Table                   | Op      | Msg_type | Msg_text |
+-------------------------+---------+----------+----------+
| courseplanner.course    | analyze | status   | OK       |
| courseplanner.prereq    | analyze | status   | OK       |
| courseplanner.antireq   | analyze | status   | OK       |
| courseplanner.user      | analyze | status   | OK       |
| courseplanner.checklist | analyze | status   | OK       |
+-------------------------+---------+----------+----------+
5 rows in set (0.03 sec)

--------------
EXPLAIN SELECT c.course_id, c.subject, c.catalog_number, c.title, c.units, c.min_term FROM Course c JOIN `User` u ON u.user_id = 1 WHERE (c.min_term IS NULL OR c.min_term <= u.next_study_term) AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM Prereq p WHERE p.course_id = c.course_id AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM Prereq alt JOIN Checklist done ON done.user_id = u.user_id AND done.course_id = alt.prereq_course_id AND done.status IN ('completed', 'in_progress') WHERE alt.course_id = p.course_id AND alt.alt_group = p.alt_group)) AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM Checklist mine WHERE mine.user_id = u.user_id AND mine.course_id = c.course_id AND mine.status IN ('completed', 'in_progress')) AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM Antireq a JOIN Checklist taken ON taken.user_id = u.user_id AND taken.status IN ('completed', 'in_progress') AND taken.course_id IN (a.course_id, a.antireq_course_id) WHERE c.course_id IN (a.course_id, a.antireq_course_id) AND taken.course_id != c.course_id) ORDER BY c.subject, c.catalog_number
--------------

+----+--------------------+-------------+------------+--------+--------------------------+---------------------+---------+------------------------------------------+------+----------+--------------------------+
| id | select_type        | table       | partitions | type   | possible_keys            | key                 | key_len | ref                                      | rows | filtered | Extra                    |
+----+--------------------+-------------+------------+--------+--------------------------+---------------------+---------+------------------------------------------+------+----------+--------------------------+
|  1 | PRIMARY            | u           | NULL       | const  | PRIMARY                  | PRIMARY             | 4       | const                                    |    1 |   100.00 | Using filesort           |
|  1 | PRIMARY            | c           | NULL       | ALL    | NULL                     | NULL                | NULL    | NULL                                     | 4616 |    40.00 | Using where              |
|  1 | PRIMARY            | <subquery4> | NULL       | eq_ref | <auto_distinct_key>      | <auto_distinct_key> | 10      | const,courseplanner.c.course_id          |    1 |   100.00 | Using where; Not exists  |
|  1 | PRIMARY            | taken       | NULL       | ref    | PRIMARY,course_id        | PRIMARY             | 4       | const                                    |   46 |   100.00 | Using where; Not exists  |
|  1 | PRIMARY            | a           | NULL       | index  | NULL                     | antireq_course_id   | 4       | NULL                                     | 1371 |   100.00 | Using where; Using index |
|  4 | MATERIALIZED       | mine        | NULL       | ref    | PRIMARY,course_id        | PRIMARY             | 4       | const                                    |   46 |   100.00 | Using where              |
|  2 | DEPENDENT SUBQUERY | p           | NULL       | ref    | PRIMARY                  | PRIMARY             | 4       | courseplanner.c.course_id                |    2 |   100.00 | NULL                     |
|  2 | DEPENDENT SUBQUERY | alt         | NULL       | ref    | PRIMARY,prereq_course_id | PRIMARY             | 4       | courseplanner.p.course_id                |    2 |   100.00 | Using where; Not exists  |
|  2 | DEPENDENT SUBQUERY | done        | NULL       | eq_ref | PRIMARY,course_id        | PRIMARY             | 8       | const,courseplanner.alt.prereq_course_id |    1 |   100.00 | Using where              |
